# NUDIMMUD HUD OS — Full Personality + Oracle Revamp Plan

## Context
Marcel wants the NUDIMMUD CLI and HUD to feel alive: a real operator tool with personality, economy-driven token use, a unified Oracle command center, local-first image pipelines, and a design artist agent. Current pain points: Oracle page has latency (single blocking REST call to local LLM, no streaming), tools scattered, VSCode not fully wired as primary IDE, no token status bar, no image pipeline, no file upload in chat.

ExeoFlow HUD reference (IMG_3198–3200): dark card layout, colored status orbs arranged in columns, operations intelligence grid, sidebar nav. That's the visual target for the ticket system + tool orbs.

