### 5a — Response Time Fix (Critical)
**Root cause:** Single blocking POST, response arrives only when LLM finishes. Stale timer hits at 10s.

**Fix:** Add SSE stream endpoint `GET /api/oracle/stream?command=...` (or upgrade to WebSocket).
- Backend: pipe `neuralForge.chat()` token stream → SSE chunks
- Bridge: add `submitOracleCommandStream()` that uses `EventSource` and updates state per chunk
- Frontend: display tokens as they arrive (typewriter effect)
- Stale soft timer bumped to 30s, hard to 60s (local LLM is slower than cloud)
- Add live token counter during generation (visible progress)

